WEBVTT

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:19.460
Mother... where are you?

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:30.080
Get away from Elli!

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:38.750
Lita!

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:42.040
It's alright now, Elli!

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:51.000
Oh, come on.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.500
It's hard to walk when you 
cling on me like that.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:54.170
But, it's just...

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:57.040
Elli, you're such a baby, you know that?

00:00:57.580 --> 00:00:59.960
We're going to be second-graders soon.

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:02.380
We'll be the big girls among 
the lower-grade students,

00:01:02.380 --> 00:01:03.830
so you have to shape up.

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:06.500
There's no need to.

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:09.460
Elli, you can already use mana, right?

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:10.710
Forget about that!

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:13.380
I just want to stay your 
"little sister" forever, Lita.

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:15.040
That's okay, isn't it?

00:01:15.790 --> 00:01:17.290
Oh, Elli...

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:15.420
Oh, come on.

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:17.460
Two Young Ladies Assemble 
at the Chained Castle

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:17.630
It's hard to walk when you 
cling on me like that.

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:19.580
Well, it's because I'm happy.

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:22.710
Starting today we're going to be
together all the time for a week, Lita.

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:24.830
Well, I'm happy about too...

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:29.500
Those two act just like 
actual sisters, don't they?

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:31.630
Yes, but...

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:33.130
What is this here?

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:33.830
Huh?

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:36.960
How many times do I need to tell you?

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:40.210
Me and you are, respectively, tutors for a
head family and a branch family of that House.

00:03:40.710 --> 00:03:42.710
We are rivals to each other.

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:44.630
I don't think it's a problem!

00:03:44.630 --> 00:03:47.630
After all, the two young 
ladies get along great!

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:49.540
Even if that's the case,

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:52.330
the issue is how our clients 
would feel about it.

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:57.920
At the very least, the head maid of your
residence doesn't seem to share your opinion.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:02.420
I hear she strong-armed her own
name onto the visitors' list.

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:05.380
She said they couldn't depend on me alone.

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:09.130
Oh my, sounds like it will be a "fun" week.

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:10.710
Well, anyway...

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:13.920
Nonetheless...

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:16.500
we have but one mission...

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:21.380
To protect the enjoyable school
life of our respective charges.

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:25.960
Who do you think the 
cadets will be this year?

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:29.540
Naturally, there's no doubt 
President Christa will be one.

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:33.130
She's already vowed that this is the
year she'll seize the title of "Luna"!

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:35.750
Well, there's no question who 
the other girl will be, either!

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:39.080
Last year's Queen, Shenfa Zwitoque!

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:41.540
How lovely the both of them are!

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:45.210
As the pride of St. Friedeswiede,
the names of those two are sure to be up there!

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:48.040
Our school will surely secure the
title of Luna again this year!

00:04:48.670 --> 00:04:52.420
A match against a sister school
gets everyone fired up, doesn't it?!

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:56.130
Seems the cadets are chosen from among the most
outstanding students in the higher grades, huh?

00:04:58.210 --> 00:04:59.750
Join my unit?

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:01.750
A-am I asking too much?

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:04.210
I-I get it.

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:07.630
For one thing, Elli, there's too much
of a disparity between our Statuses,

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:10.130
and, as for our actual abilities...

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:11.330
But...!

00:05:11.630 --> 00:05:12.380
If...

00:05:12.630 --> 00:05:16.500
If I could somehow fight alongside you,
it would be just wonderful.

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:24.250
Good morning, Melida.

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:28.130
Good morning, Nerva.

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:32.790
Lita...

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:34.790
Good morning, everyone.

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:36.710
Elli, let's go.

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:43.380
At long last, today marks the start of this
year's Luna Lumiere Selection Tournament!

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:45.380
As you know,

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:49.580
the Luna Lumiere Selection 
Tournament is a joint event

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:53.420
conducted with our sister school,
St. d'Autriche Girls' Academy.

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:59.670
With the title of "Moon Goddess: Luna Lumiere"
on the line, the cadets representing each school

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:01.920
will confront a harsh trial.

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:04.210
The "Luna Lumiere Selection Tournament"...

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:08.170
With two students selected from each school,
there's a total of four students who compete.

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:09.290
Furthermore...

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:11.380
During the weeklong period 
when the tournament is held,

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:14.130
all contact with the 
outside world is cut off.

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:18.420
The trial that the cadets will undertake takes
place on the final day of the tournament.

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:21.750
However, that alone does not
determine the tournament's outcome.

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:23.880
For the next seven days,

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:25.380
your conduct within the school,

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:27.380
the effort you show with 
regard to the trial...

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:30.710
All of those are things 
you may be judged upon.

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:32.790
Your performance in the trial,

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:34.960
as well as the votes cast by everyone...

00:06:35.210 --> 00:06:39.750
Based on those results,
the cadet who receives the most points overall

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:43.330
will officially receive the 
distinction of "Luna Lumiere"!

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:49.210
That surprise you, Salacha?

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:51.250
Keira...

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:54.920
They're the Valkyries who 
guard this glass palace.

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:59.040
No one will be allowed entry to the palace
without having received permission!

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:01.040
If you desire to enter,

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:03.790
present proof that you have 
bene given permission!

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:05.630
Fascinating, aren't they?

00:07:05.630 --> 00:07:06.710
Yeah...

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:11.880
Keira Espada...

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:15.290
along with the rest of the group from
St. d'Autriche Girls' Academy.

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:16.830
We have received permission.

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:18.630
Allow us to pass.

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:23.960
It would seem they are 
being allowed to enter.

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:27.420
Now, let us greet our friends!

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:33.670
Welcome!

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:37.460
Sure enough, one of d'Autriche's 
cadets is Keira.

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:39.210
She's d'Autriche's "Prince"!

00:07:39.210 --> 00:07:40.500
Who's that next to her?

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:42.420
It seems to be a first-year student...

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:44.880
Now that you mention it, I've heard of her.

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:46.580
Word is they've got this 
amazing first-year girl...

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:48.290
She's cute, isn't she?

00:07:57.580 --> 00:08:01.460
And now, moving right along,
allow me to present our academy's cadets.

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:03.170
The cadets are...

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:08.290
They must be kidding, right?

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:14.170
The cadets are...

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:17.420
Melida Angel and Elise Angel.

00:08:18.170 --> 00:08:20.750
But why...? This can't be happening...

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:22.880
The two of you, come up here.

00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:32.710
Quiet down!

00:08:33.170 --> 00:08:35.880
We now assembled together the
cadets from both academies.

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:39.040
Next, allow me to unveil 
details of the trial.

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:44.540
In this commemorable 50th year of the
Luna Lumiere Selection Tournament,

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:48.000
the trial will be held right 
here in Glassmond Palace.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:55.250
The trial is a round-robin battle royal between
groups of three students, each led by a cadet.

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:59.750
Each student will have a medal
like this pinned to their chest,

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:03.170
and the team that captures the most of them
within the time limit will be declared the winner.

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:04.710
Without further ado...

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:09.290
Let us have the cadets each
select two of their schoolmates.

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:12.330
Melida Angel, we will start with you.

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:15.670
Who will fight alongside you?

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:18.540
W-well...

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:22.670
Melida?

00:09:23.670 --> 00:09:24.750
I will!

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:34.880
Well then, I'll be the other teammate.

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:48.500
Listen here, all I did was take responsibility
as your former Blumen teammate.

00:09:48.960 --> 00:09:50.790
I look forward to teaming up, Melida.

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:52.920
Y-yeah...

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:57.210
The cadets and their units, who together will
be taking on this year's trial, have assembled.

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:01.540
And now, from this very moment,
let the selection tournament begin.

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:03.460
Chained Castle!

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:16.040
There's something suspicious about that
"incompetent talented girl" being named as a cadet.

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:20.130
It was really painful seeing the
disappointment on President Christa's face.

00:10:20.130 --> 00:10:21.670
There's gotta be some kinda ploy at work...

00:10:21.670 --> 00:10:24.330
Yeah, I bet she secretly 
switched the stained glass!

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:25.290
How horrible!

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:29.460
I...

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:31.210
I didn't do it!

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:32.500
I...

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:35.670
Milady...

00:10:36.420 --> 00:10:38.380
Even if the whole world 
harbors suspicions about you,

00:10:38.540 --> 00:10:40.460
I alone will stand by you.

00:10:41.920 --> 00:10:43.130
Instructor...

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:45.080
So please, milady.

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:46.790
Believe in me.

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.670
Especially when I say that I believe in you.

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:52.460
Okay.

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:58.290
Garrick Hammer!

00:10:59.210 --> 00:11:00.580
Impartation Unsheathing!

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:07.250
You need to work the timing 
of that sword draw!

00:11:07.420 --> 00:11:08.170
Understood.

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:10.080
Hey!

00:11:10.170 --> 00:11:13.750
Could you at least make 
my weapon a bit lighter?!

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:17.630
If Melida gets injured, it will 
cause problems for all of us.

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:18.830
No can do.

00:11:18.830 --> 00:11:20.960
That would reduce the sense of tension.

00:11:21.420 --> 00:11:25.500
When you're able to amp it up to 120 percent,
you'll finally be able to use it in the actual match.

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:28.000
At least let us take a little break.

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:30.920
I'm asking for my own sake too, Instructor.

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:33.040
I suppose there's no helping it.

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:36.420
Milady, let's take a short rest.

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:38.750
O-okay.

00:11:45.960 --> 00:11:46.920
The way things stand,

00:11:46.920 --> 00:11:49.710
no way I can go toe-to-toe 
in combat with Elli...

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:54.670
How do you do, Melida Angel?

00:12:01.420 --> 00:12:03.790
The "incompetent talented 
girl" of Friedeswiede.

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:06.670
You're famous, you know.

00:12:06.670 --> 00:12:08.210
Two young ladies from the House of Angel,

00:12:08.210 --> 00:12:10.460
one from the head family and
one from the branch family...

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:14.630
It's quite ironic that the both of
you were selected as cadets.

00:12:16.710 --> 00:12:21.670
In part for the sake of publicly showing that
you're a genuine descendant of a Duke House,

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:23.330
you must come out victorious...

00:12:23.960 --> 00:12:25.580
...over Elise Angel.

00:12:25.580 --> 00:12:27.130
But that's not something I...

00:12:27.750 --> 00:12:30.130
If you have such power, you must not waver.

00:12:30.710 --> 00:12:33.830
It is through the display of it that
people will come to trust you.

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:35.790
If you want to accomplish something,

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:39.000
you must demonstrate that you
have that power within you...

00:12:40.670 --> 00:12:43.710
Demonstrate... my power...

00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:48.460
I'll be cheering you on, Melida.

00:12:48.670 --> 00:12:50.170
Uh, um...

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:57.750
Milady.

00:12:58.670 --> 00:12:59.580
Instructor...

00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:00.960
Who was that student just now?

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:02.880
Um, let's see...

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:04.790
She's from d'Autriche...

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:09.210
but I failed to get her name.

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:26.830
I see you're burning the midnight 
oil to destroy evidence.

00:13:30.250 --> 00:13:32.330
Wh-what are you talking about?

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:38.750
Excuse me...

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:40.250
Wha-?!

00:13:43.830 --> 00:13:47.000
This is... a shard from the 
stained glass, isn't it?

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:50.170
For someone of your high standing,
you were quite careless.

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:52.290
I-impossible!

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:53.880
I made sure to check 
myself over this morning.

00:13:53.880 --> 00:13:56.960
Ah, I see. So you made the 
swap last night, then.

00:13:57.960 --> 00:13:59.460
You let the cat out of the bag.

00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:04.080
This glass shard isn't from 
the stained glass you broke.

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:06.080
I brought it here myself.

00:14:07.210 --> 00:14:09.790
And that's the score, young ladies.

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:11.460
Mrs. Othello...

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:15.000
L-Lady Elise! I was simply...

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:15.790
Why?

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:17.130
"Why," you ask?

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:20.170
Needless to say, for your sake, milady.

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:22.750
If the two of you vie with one 
another in a public setting,

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:25.420
people will inevitably see which of you
has the qualifications to be an Angel.

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:29.670
So, you did this in order to make the two
young ladies compete directly against each other?!

00:14:29.710 --> 00:14:31.000
Precisely.

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:33.500
I've exhausted my patience!

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:37.380
The idea of that "incompetent talented girl"
standing beside Lady Elise as an equal is too much!

00:14:37.380 --> 00:14:39.670
Being all friendly and acting 
like close schoolmates...

00:14:39.670 --> 00:14:41.460
Ah, it makes me sick to my stomach!

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:43.040
But even so...!

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:47.250
Elli and I are tied together by precious,
irreplaceable bonds!

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:51.290
If you want to accomplish something,

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:54.250
you must demonstrate that you
have that power within you...

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:57.460
So, please acknowledge me!

00:14:57.670 --> 00:15:01.000
If... If I manage to triumph 
over Elli in the trial...

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:03.670
If I prove that I'm not "incompetent"...

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:06.880
please permit me to form 
a unit together with Elli!

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:11.330
Lita...

00:15:19.670 --> 00:15:21.500
Excellently done back there.

00:15:21.710 --> 00:15:22.420
Huh?

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:29.210
That was... I was caught up in the moment...

00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:31.290
That's the kind of thing 
that makes you my pupil.

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:35.500
Catching your opponent off their guard and
hammering them with an unexpected attack...

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:37.540
You did a really great job.

00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:39.170
Instructor...

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:45.250
Well, it would be nice if you could
nail the transition from the

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:48.170
Impartation Unsheathing to the
Feather Slash that skillfully, though.

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:49.040
Oh, come on!

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:51.710
Good night.

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:54.750
Good night, Instructor.

00:16:11.920 --> 00:16:15.580
I never imagined that Mrs. Othello
would do something so wildly reckless.

00:16:20.420 --> 00:16:24.250
It's the first time I've seen 
milady looking so distressed.

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:40.330
An emissary of the White Night.

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:45.250
What is this all about?

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:52.750
It's been a while.

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:54.830
I figured it had to be you...

00:16:54.830 --> 00:16:56.580
Black Madia.

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:11.880
Elli...

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:14.580
What have you come here to do?

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:17.880
They think the report was 
incomplete last time.

00:17:20.710 --> 00:17:21.750
Your loyalty is under question.

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:24.420
I did nothing more than 
frankly report the facts.

00:17:24.420 --> 00:17:26.250
There are no grounds for doubting me!

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:29.460
Nothing hidden?

00:17:30.420 --> 00:17:31.500
Of course not!

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:36.580
Bring me the blood of Melida Angel.

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:40.080
Why didn't the mana awake until now?

00:17:40.920 --> 00:17:43.130
It needs further researching.

00:17:44.170 --> 00:17:45.040
Stop it with this nonsense!

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:47.580
I'm currently an employee 
of the House of Angel.

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:50.670
I can't do anything that would
threaten my position with them!

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:54.540
I will harvest it myself, then.

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:55.210
As if I'd let you!

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:11.040
Exposed your true colors?

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:13.500
Is it fine if I interpret it like that?

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:17.080
I currently serve as milady's attendant.

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:19.130
And I will do my duty!

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:27.670
What do you mean by "lose on purpose"?

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:29.170
Just what it sounds like.

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:31.920
I'll lose to you in the trial, Lita.

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:36.630
If I do that, Mrs. Othello will be
forced to acknowledge your ability.

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:38.960
But that... wouldn't be 
my real ability at all!

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:40.540
That's alright.

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:43.460
What matters is the way it looks.

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:46.380
Elli, you...

00:18:50.330 --> 00:18:51.630
What's the matter with you?

00:18:55.420 --> 00:18:56.500
I'm filled with excitement 
for the first time in ages.

00:18:56.540 --> 00:18:57.420
Cut the crap!

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:05.500
Rosetti.

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:07.540
I've already gone and notified 
the academy director!

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:10.420
Didn't I tell you there was 
no need for you to come?

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:12.170
That wasn't going to fly with me.

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:13.920
Who the hell is that?!

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:16.210
Carrier Marquis.

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:19.380
The protector of the other Angel.

00:19:19.540 --> 00:19:21.540
Wh-what's with this girl?!

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:23.000
Well, never mind that.

00:19:23.460 --> 00:19:26.290
Any who dare disturb the peace
of the academy shall be ejected!

00:19:30.420 --> 00:19:31.500
She's got two weapons?!

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:39.790
What the hell?!

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:41.710
Just who are you?!

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:47.460
The girl is in good hands.

00:19:51.130 --> 00:19:53.630
Is that girl perhaps the one...?

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:56.080
Playtime is over.

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:01.460
Instructor Kufa!

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:03.290
Are you somewhere over there?

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:05.130
Where's the suspicious individual?

00:20:05.210 --> 00:20:06.380
Could they be over that way?

00:20:06.380 --> 00:20:07.460
Let's hurry now.

00:20:07.960 --> 00:20:09.750
I assume you'd like to avoid 
being spotted by them.

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:11.960
Beat a retreat.

00:20:14.210 --> 00:20:15.580
Don't forget.

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:17.630
I'm the shadow.

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:23.920
A shadow will always be...

00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:27.420
behind you.

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:31.250
The way she fought... Never 
seen anything like it.

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:33.250
Just what the hell is she?

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:36.040
Her Class is Clown.

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:40.460
Fencer, Gladiator, Samurai,

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:44.670
Maiden, Gunner, Wizard, Cleric...

00:20:46.170 --> 00:20:48.880
With the ability to imitate 
all seven Classes...

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:55.960
she is the strongest 
Clown in all of Flandore.

00:20:56.580 --> 00:20:59.920
Elli... so you're saying I 
have no chance of beating you?

00:21:00.380 --> 00:21:02.460
You can't... right?

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:09.250
I will lose during the 
trial one week from now.

00:21:10.210 --> 00:21:12.750
If I do that, we can form 
a unit together, Lita...

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:14.830
Am I wrong?

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:17.460
Still, the very idea of it...

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:19.380
It's not for your sake, Lita.

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:22.540
I'm going to do it for my own.

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:24.130
Elli...

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:27.380
There's nothing left to say.

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:29.580
Good night, Lita.

00:21:40.790 --> 00:21:41.750
Hey, Lita...

00:21:43.040 --> 00:21:46.290
I want to stay being your 
"little sister" forever.

00:21:48.830 --> 00:21:49.500
So that's why...

00:23:35.960 --> 00:23:40.790
Next Episode
The Golden Princess and the Silver Princess
